            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The invention provides a foldable push chair comprising: a central body assembly extending across the push chair substantially horizontally and perpendicularly to the normal direction of travel of the push chair, a handle assembly connected to the central body and extending therefrom; at least three wheel supporting legs rotatable around the central body and extending from the central body, in the unfolded state one or more wheel supporting legs extending in a forward direction from the central body and one or more wheel supporting legs extending in a rearward direction from the central body; the forward and rearward extending legs being arranged such that they rotate in opposite directions around the central body during a folding or unfolding operation.</p>
